# Skip dependency lifecycle scripts during install.
#
# Required for Firebase App Hosting builds: NFeWizard-io pulls in
# `xsd-schema-validator`, whose postinstall compiles a Java helper and hard-fails
# ("Java SDK required at JAVA_HOME") on the App Hosting build image, which has no
# JDK. We never use the Java-based XSD validator — the fiscal code forces the
# pure-JS validator (`lib.useForSchemaValidation = 'validateSchemaJsBased'` in
# src/lib/fiscal/nfewizard/client.ts).
#
# Safe for the other native deps in the tree: sharp (0.34) and esbuild ship
# their platform binaries as prebuilt optional dependencies (@img/sharp-*,
# @esbuild/*), which install without running a script.
ignore-scripts=true
